  m_Name: Events
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArticlePageData
  title: Events
  bodyText: "Municipal Event Briefing: Citywide All-Day Puppy Play Date & Adoption
    Fair\r\n\r\nThe New Manila City Dog Shelter invites local residents to participate
    in our quarterly All-Day Puppy Play Date. This municipal initiative promotes
    early canine behavioral socialization, public education on humane pet ownership,
    and rehoming opportunities for eligible rescue puppies.\r\n\r\nKey Event Details\r\nInformation
    Field\r\nOfficial Event Details\r\nDate & Time\r\nSaturday, October 24, 2026
    | 9:00 AM \u2013 4:30 PM\r\nLocation\r\n New Manila City Dog Shelter\r\nAdmission
    Fee\r\nFree (Mandatory online pre-registration required)\r\nPortal Link\r\nwww.newmanila.gov.ph/services/dogshelter/events\r\n\r\n\r\nSession
    Schedule & Timetable\r\n\r\nSession 1 (Morning Block): 9:00 AM \u2013 10:30 AM\r\n\r\nSession
    2 (Midday Block): 11:00 AM \u2013 12:30 PM\r\n\r\nSanitization Intermission:
    12:30 PM \u2013 1:30 PM (Facility closed for cleaning and feeding)\r\n\r\nSession
    3 (Afternoon Block): 1:30 PM \u2013 3:00 PM\r\n\r\nSession 4 (Final Block): 3:30
    PM \u2013 4:30 PM (Open interaction & final adoption interviews)"
  images: []
